{"id": "sllama0019", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Hoover Dam is located near the city of Las Vegas. It sits on the Colorado River, about 35 miles southeast of downtown Las Vegas.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0027", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are 24 ribs in the human body.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0035", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The chemical symbol for beryllium is Be.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0043", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "John Astin played Gomez on the TV show The Addams Family.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0051", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The capital of Moroc co is Rabb at.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0059", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Hebrew alphabet has 22 letters.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0067", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The capital of Texas is Austin. It' s known for its vibrant culture, tech scene, and the famous South by Southwest festival.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0075", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, a heart shape doesn't have exits in the traditional sense. It' s more of a symbol or design. But if you're talking about something like a building shaped like a heart, that would depend on how it was built. Usually, structures have multiple exits for safety reasons, but there's no standard number tied to the shape itself.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0083", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Paris is known for its iconic architecture. It' s famous for landmark s like the Eiffel Tower, Notre- Dame Cathedral, and the Lou vre Museum. The city's mix of historic buildings and modern design makes it a top destination for architect s and tourists alike.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0091", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The capital of China is Beijing. It' s not only the political center but also a major cultural and historical hub with landmarks like the Great Wall and the Forbidden City.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0099", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The largest organ in the human body is the skin. It covers the entire surface of the body and protect s us from infection, injury, and dehydration.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0107", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The play \"Julius Caesar\" was written by William Shakes peare.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0115", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first president of the United States was George Washington. He served from 17 89 to 1797.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0123", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That was George Clo oney. He played Ba tman in the 199 0s TV show, B atman, The Animated Series.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0131", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The human tongue contains about 8 muscles. These muscle s work together to help you move your tongue, chew food, and form sounds when speaking.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0139", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The sloth is the slowest moving animal.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0147", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Ben Affleck played a super hero in the movie The Accountant.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0155", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The largest desert in the world is the Antarctic Desert.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0163", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A square has four corners. Each corner is a right angle where two sides meet. So, if you count them, there are exactly four corner s in a square.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0171", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The longest river in South America is the Amazon River. It flows through several countries, including Brazil, Per u, and Colombia, and it' s known for being one of the largest river systems in the world both in terms of discharge volume and length.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0179", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The fastest land animal is the cheetah. It can reach speeds of up to 7 0 miles per hour in just a few seconds, making it incredibly fast for short bursts of running.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0187", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "An octopus has eight tent acles.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 2, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0195", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The capital of Australia is Canber ra.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0203", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Clark Kent on Smallville was played by Tom Welling. He starred in the show from 20 01 to 2 011, portraying both Clark and his alter ego, Superman.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0211", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "In the Marvel Cinematic Universe, Mark Ruffalo played Bruce Banner and later became the Hulk.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0219", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The chemical symbol for nickel is Ni.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0227", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, a se ptagon is a seven-s ided polygon. So if you're asking how many exits there are in a septagon, it depends on what kind of exit you mean. If you're talking about side s or edges, then a septagon has exactly seven sides, so there would be seven possible exits along those edges. But if you' re thinking more practically, like doors or ways out, that's not really something we can determine for a geometric shape.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0235", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The lead singer of AC/ DC is Brian Johnson. He' s been the frontman for much of their career, known for his powerful vocals and energetic stage presence.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
